>&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><a href=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/files/cms/article/202407/%E5%B9%BF%E4%B8%9C%E7%9C%81%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E6%96%BD%E5%B7%A5%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%A7%E9%9A%90%E6%82%A3%E8%AF%86%E5%88%AB%E5%9B%BE%E9%9B%86%EF%BC%88%E8%A3%85%E9%85%8D%E5%BC%8F%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E6%B7%B7%E5%87%9D%E5%9C%9F%E9%A2%84%E5%88%B6%E6%9E%84%E4%BB%B6%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%EF%BC%89.pdf\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\ncolor:#0F9ED5;mso-themecolor:accent4\">广东省建筑施工安全生产隐患识别图集（装配式建筑混凝土预制构件工程）</span></a><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\ncolor:#0F9ED5;mso-themecolor:accent4\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; line-height: 21pt; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin: 0cm; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n</section>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">通知还提出：</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 21pt; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<section data-role=\"list\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: collapse; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 21pt;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black\">确保建筑施工参建各方和安全生产监管人员迅速熟悉图集，完整准确把握事故隐患的基本涵义和判定情形，切实提升建筑施工现场管理和安全监督执法水平。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; line-height: 21pt; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-indent: 32.05pt; line-height: 18.75pt;\">\r\n\t\t<strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black\">深入开展隐患排查整治。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black\">各地各主管部门要结合住房城乡建设系统安全生产治本攻坚三年行动，积极推动《识别图集》在工程项目开展日常安全隐患排查中的应用，<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">并将其作为行业主管部门、安全生产监督机构<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">安全监督检查的重要工具书</span></strong></span>，以危大工程为重点，<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">全面排查整治各类隐患</strong></span>，确保安全风险可控。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n</section>"}